---
const evaluationUrl = 'https://github.com/mohseenjamall/FontCraft/blob/main/EVALUATION.md';
---

<section class="section" id="compare">
  <div class="section-bar"><div class="container section-bar-inner"><span>03 / Compare</span><span>Measured 21 Nov 2026</span></div></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 data-reveal>Smaller, faster, and missing some things</h2>
      <p class="lede" data-reveal>
        FontBase is still the fuller font manager. FontCraft is the faster browser. The numbers
        come from one machine, three runs per app, median result.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="table-block" data-reveal>
      <div class="table-head">
        <h3>Speed and size</h3>
        <p class="meta">FontBase 2026.7.4 vs FontCraft 1.0.0</p>
      </div>

      <table>
        <caption class="sr-only">
          Benchmark results for FontBase 2026.7.4 and FontCraft 1.0.0
        </caption>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Measure</th>
            <th scope="col">FontBase</th>
            <th scope="col">FontCraft</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Ready after start</th>
            <td><span class="num">6.21 s</span></td>
            <td><span class="num strong">1.46 s</span><span class="delta">about 4x faster</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Memory in use</th>
            <td><span class="num">784 MB</span></td>
            <td><span class="num strong">104 MB</span><span class="delta">7.5x less</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">CPU time while starting</th>
            <td><span class="num">9.95 s</span></td>
            <td><span class="num strong">0.81 s</span><span class="delta">about 12x less</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Disk space</th>
            <td><span class="num">438.3 MB</span></td>
            <td><span class="num strong">6.3 MB</span><span class="delta">70x smaller</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Processes</th>
            <td><span class="num">5</span></td>
            <td><span class="num strong">1</span><span class="delta">5x fewer</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Threads</th>
            <td><span class="num">182</span></td>
            <td><span class="num strong">18</span><span class="delta">10x fewer</span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <p class="footnote">
        Measured 21 November 2026 on an AMD Ryzen 7 5800X, 32 GB RAM, Windows 11, with about 270
        families and 540 styles. Median of 3 runs. <a class="text-link" href={evaluationUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Full
        method and raw results</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="table-block" data-reveal>
      <div class="table-head">
        <h3>Features</h3>
        <p class="meta">FontCraft 1.1.0</p>
      </div>

      <table>
        <caption class="sr-only">
          Feature comparison for FontBase and FontCraft 1.1.0
        </caption>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Feature</th>
            <th scope="col">FontBase</th>
            <th scope="col">FontCraft</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">All fonts in one list, grouped by family</th>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Live preview with your own text</th>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Preview size 6-180 px</th>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Right sample for non-Latin scripts</th>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Family details and waterfall</th>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Search by name</th>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Add your own font folders</th>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Turn fonts on or off without deleting files</th>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Reads fonts FontBase activated</th>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Works offline, no account</th>
            <td><span class="status partly">Partly</span></td>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Collections and tags</th>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
            <td><span class="status coming">Coming</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Character map</th>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
            <td><span class="status coming">Coming</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">OpenType feature controls</th>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
            <td><span class="status coming">Coming</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Variable-font sliders</th>
            <td><span class="status">Yes</span></td>
            <td><span class="status coming">Coming</span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <p class="footnote">
        FontBase rows are limited to features confirmed in its files. For FontBase, Partly means
        its sign-in features need an account. Coming means the feature is not in FontCraft today.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .table-block + .table-block {
    margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .table-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }

  .table-head h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.2vw, 1.8rem);
  }

  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;
  }

  th,
  td {
    padding: 13px 12px;
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }

  thead th {
    padding-top: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  tbody th {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  td {
    color: var(--ink-dim);
  }

  th:first-child,
  td:first-child {
    width: 44%;
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  th:last-child,
  td:last-child {
    padding-right: 0;
  }

  .num {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .num.strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .delta {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 2px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .status {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .status.partly {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .status.coming {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .footnote {
    max-width: 74ch;
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    th,
    td {
      padding: 11px 7px;
    }

    th:first-child,
    td:first-child {
      width: 46%;
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    tbody th {
      font-size: 0.86rem;
    }

    .num {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .delta {
      font-size: 8px;
    }
  }
</style>
